-- Q3165: Advanced Consolidations [easy/L1]
-- Issues: #1, #3
UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["As a liability owed to the minority shareholders by the consolidated entity","Off-balance-sheet with disclosure only in the notes to financial statements","As a deduction from total assets on the consolidated balance sheet","As a separate component of stockholders'' equity on the consolidated balance sheet"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under ASC 810-10-45-16, noncontrolling interest is reported as a separate component within stockholders'' equity on the consolidated balance sheet. This presentation reflects that minority shareholders hold an equity interest in the consolidated entity, not a liability claim against it.
